{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I am here, in this world...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Japanese-style fantasy adventure by Kogado Studio.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this town, strange incidents never cease.<br>The cause? Beings born from the darkness of the human heart: Demon Spirits.<br>Join Satoree Mizuki, a girl who can read others\u2019 minds, and uncover the truth behind these supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u203bThis work does not contain voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...I can\u2019t remember anything. <br>Through the haze of my fading consciousness, a girl\u2019s voice faintly echoes in my ears. <br>When I open my eyes, I find her staring at me, her face filled with uncertainty. <br>According to her, this town is plagued by Demon Spirits, creatures that lurk in the shadows, bringing disaster to those who cross their path. <br>And one of them... stole my memories. <br>With the guidance of this girl, I step into a world of exorcism and supernatural battles without a single clue about my identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Yuto Kamizuki, is a Kotodama User whose words can shape reality. <br>Harness the power of Kotodama and exorcise Demon Spirits alongside Satoree Mizuki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production : KOGADO STUDIO,INC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning :\u00a0Kawasyonin49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design : Herigaru, Ringopann</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming : Noguchi Ryukei, Hinata Anan, Funayama Kazuma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theme song</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kagami No Hanasaku Tsukiyo&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raito &amp; Yagatechi Bayashi feat. Abe Rika</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme song copyright : Lisa-rec, Inc.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dear Mirror Flower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/aa16e87eef0f4e23de11ef6b0488fd6283fc0c65.jpg"},{"name":"Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/b035444cad96fe965b90d56a342cb5a67c9c52c4.jpg"},{"name":"Miyu Amagiri","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/d2de1798145eecc850c23200ee178e587316a957.jpg"},{"name":"Delly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/5ab5fdb24295fafbe219321de03fd18a3d3d9cc5.jpg"},{"name":"Day Mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/4e125f9515749c2bd330fd995135b492bdbcac45.jpg"},{"name":"Reunion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/287ad0cef47d61ddee922df427d27865d5727070.jpg"},{"name":"Amusement Park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/c9b92a12fe673204c671b67329ad834dff67620e.jpg"},{"name":"Satoree Minazuki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/aa36ad66ea896cce2568797f92a250865b9e9f86.jpg"},{"name":"Baku","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/f057132e371edcdf6415ca6514a2777a36481512.jpg"},{"name":"A popular streamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543570/33e59e2b139b1bb4823f2699ed488602fa7a5b75.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steam